<h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.25;color:#0a0a0a;">
  Staff password updated
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 22px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5ba60b;">
  Security confirmation
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Hi {{name}},
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  The password for your Dukka staff account <strong>{{email}}</strong> was changed successfully. You can continue using the staff portal with your new credentials.
</p>

{{#> details}}
  {{> detail-row label="Staff email" value=email}}
  {{> detail-row label="Status" value="Password changed"}}
{{/details}}

{{#> tip title="Wasn't you?"}}
  If you did not make this change, contact an administrator right away and secure your account. Unauthorized password changes should be treated as a security incident.
{{/tip}}

<p style="margin:0;">
  Thank you for helping keep Dukka operations safe.
</p>
